      "number": 1312,
      "body": "## Token Addition\n\n**Token:** ET10 (EventTrader 10 Index)  \n**Chain:** Base (8453)  \n**Contract:** `0x0EbCc78E657b714c1821a1Be0Ad1067100f309f7`  \n**Decimals:** 18\n\n## About\n\nET10 is the governance and utility token for [EventTrader](https://cymetica.com?utm_source=github&utm_medium=pr&utm_campaign=ai-native-outreach&utm_content=ethereum-optimism--ethereum-optimism.github.io), an AI-powered perpetual prediction market platform deployed on Base. The token enables:\n- Platform governance voting\n- Fee distribution to holders  \n- Staking rewards\n- AI agent marketplace access\n\n## Verification\n\n- [BaseScan Verified Contract](https://basescan.org/token/0x0EbCc78E657b714c1821a1Be0Ad1067100f309f7)\n- [GoPlus Security Audit](https://gopluslabs.io/token-security/8453/0x0EbCc78E657b714c1821a1Be0Ad1067100f309f7)\n- Exchange: `0x6dC111ffB79ba7C892665329c10C2035119C91bf`\n- Distributor: `0x1744642589059cDA7db0998Bb8D15Dd83C407bb5`\n\n## Note\n\nLogo file (`logo.png`) to be added in a follow-up commit. Happy to provide in any required dimensions/format.",
